1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,560
Using language. Reading. Futuriscope. Excitement and learning.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,020
Last week I took a journey deep into space to the end of the solar system and was pulled

3
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:24,940
Then I took a trip to Brazil and experienced surviving an airplane crash in the jungle.

4
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:32,100
After that, I joined some divers and went to the bottom of the ocean to see strange blind creatures

5
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,060
that have never seen sunlight.

6
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:41,480
For a break, I took part in some car racing and then skied down some of the most difficult mountains in the world.

7
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:46,120
I ended my travels by meeting face to face with a dinosaur,

8
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:49,980
the terrible T-Rex, and survived the experience!

9
00:01:04,740 --> 00:01:10,240
This science and technology-based theme park in France uses the most advanced technology.

10
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:22,740
Visitors can get close to parts of the world they have never experienced,

11
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,560
going to the bottom of the ocean,

12
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:28,640
flying through the jungle or visiting the edges of the solar system.

13
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:33,760
The amazing, up-to-date information together with many opportunities

14
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:38,840
for hands-on learning makes the world come to life in a completely new way

15
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,540
for visitors.

16
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:55,840
I bought tickets for myself and my friends at the park's entrance,

17
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:58,820
but tickets are also available online.

18
00:02:40,340 --> 00:02:45,380
Come ready to walk a lot - be sure to wear some comfortable sneakers or other walking shoes!
